{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "HLS 直播流转码:转码平均耗时(按 video_id)。数据源是 api 手拼 /business-metrics 的 business_hls_transcode_seconds{video_id}。该族标签值是开放集(视频 id 由真实转码事件产生),因此**本机尚未发生过转码时面板为 No data 是事实**,不是采集坏掉 —— 与\"注册了却零样本\"那一型不同,这里没有可开的封闭枚举基线。",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "返回 AI 总览",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ihui-ai-overview",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "tags": ["ihui-ai"]
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "转码延迟 (ms)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(business_hls_transcode_seconds_sum{instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(business_hls_transcode_seconds_count{instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{video_id}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 1
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["ihui-ai", "domain:hls", "hls", "live"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=\"business-metrics\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "IHUI-AI HLS 直播流监控",
  "uid": "ihui-ai-hls",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
